  "body_html": "<h1>Truthfulness From DSIC</h1>\n<p>In a direct mechanism, if truthful reporting is dominant-strategy incentive\ncompatible, then the truthful reporting profile is a Nash equilibrium of the\ninduced strategic game.</p>",
